00:25:27.820 --> 00:25:28.220
Councilator.

00:25:29.440 --> 00:25:29.740
Why?

00:25:30.670 --> 00:25:33.970
Because the artifact contains Serok's original writings.

00:25:34.370 --> 00:25:37.060
Only the priests on Saleia can translate them.

00:25:39.050 --> 00:25:40.970
If you are deceiving me...

00:25:41.060 --> 00:25:42.960
I am a Sirenite. We don't lie.

00:26:00.920 --> 00:26:01.660
I need to rest.

00:26:01.920 --> 00:26:03.800
If you're attempting to delay us, it won't work.

00:26:04.220 --> 00:26:05.340
We'll find your friends.

00:26:15.150 --> 00:26:15.550
Changed.

00:26:17.530 --> 00:26:19.350
I served under you during the Tome Admission.

00:26:19.490 --> 00:26:21.800
You don't remember me?

00:26:22.060 --> 00:26:23.360
It's a very long time around.

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:26.600
You were a fine officer then.

00:26:27.910 --> 00:26:29.110
Why did you betray us?

00:26:31.340 --> 00:26:36.240
They must have offered you something. Perhaps you enjoy hiding bombs in embassies?

00:26:36.580 --> 00:26:37.620
We weren't responsible.

00:26:38.340 --> 00:26:40.360
Two of my men were killed in the embassy explosion.

00:26:40.770 --> 00:26:44.180
You have been misled. Syranites are peaceful.

00:26:45.280 --> 00:26:47.700
They have spared your life because you were once my superior.

00:26:48.470 --> 00:26:49.950
Your companions won't be so fortunate.

00:26:53.140 --> 00:26:54.220
Bridge to Commander Shran.

00:26:55.100 --> 00:26:55.700
What is it?

00:26:55.900 --> 00:26:58.200
The General is asking for an update on the interrogation.

00:26:58.320 --> 00:26:59.940
Tell him I'll contact him when I'm ready!

00:27:00.730 --> 00:27:06.840
Find this amusing?

00:27:08.960 --> 00:27:12.040
Ordinarily I wouldn't, but because of this device.

00:27:12.670 --> 00:27:19.620
There are three higher settings on that panel, if I use them.

00:27:21.960 --> 00:27:27.940
You're afraid to injure me. If I were you, I'd leave that detail out of your report to the general.

00:27:31.780 --> 00:27:33.650
I was a fool.

00:27:34.070 --> 00:27:34.710
I think you'd listen.

00:27:35.750 --> 00:27:37.330
Perhaps the High Command was right,

00:27:37.530 --> 00:27:40.290
or you'll be better off when Endory will fall.

00:27:42.900 --> 00:27:43.380
Report!

00:27:43.780 --> 00:27:45.100
It's the Starfleet ship!

00:27:45.880 --> 00:27:47.420
Direct hit to their shield generator.

00:27:47.660 --> 00:27:49.140
See if you can get a lock on Saval.

00:27:49.740 --> 00:27:52.200
Should we return fire?

00:27:53.140 --> 00:27:55.600
Are you going to make enemies of the humans as well?

00:28:02.140 --> 00:28:04.860
Lieutenant, order our ships out of the nebula.

00:28:05.340 --> 00:28:05.660
Commander?

00:28:05.920 --> 00:28:08.700
And tell Enterprise we'll be returning the ambassador shortly.

00:28:09.510 --> 00:28:09.890
Understood.

00:28:11.050 --> 00:28:12.370
Get that thing off of him.

00:28:23.080 --> 00:28:23.840
Away from the capital.

00:28:27.220 --> 00:28:27.840
She's with them.

00:28:32.460 --> 00:28:33.160
Where are you going?

00:28:33.300 --> 00:28:34.480
To find my science officer.

00:28:34.740 --> 00:28:36.760
And I don't want to hear any lectures about the needs of the many.

00:28:37.240 --> 00:28:38.260
I got enough of that crap from them.

00:28:42.100 --> 00:28:43.620
There's no logic to your plan.

00:28:44.490 --> 00:28:45.410
We have no weapons.

00:28:45.450 --> 00:28:48.270
If they take the Kishara from you, they'll destroy it.

00:28:48.410 --> 00:28:49.150
I'm going to find her.

00:29:07.800 --> 00:29:08.280
How is he?

00:29:09.060 --> 00:29:10.880
You've got a lot of nerve pretending you give a damn.

00:29:11.450 --> 00:29:12.890
I did what was necessary.

00:29:14.900 --> 00:29:15.680
Soval would understand.

00:29:16.860 --> 00:29:18.740
He should be fine in another day or so.

00:29:19.490 --> 00:29:20.850
He risked his life coming here.

00:29:21.500 --> 00:29:23.280
And you paid him back by scrambling his neurons.

00:29:23.480 --> 00:29:25.280
He's not the only one taking a risk.

00:29:26.500 --> 00:29:28.220
I just spoke with the Imperial Guard.

00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:29.960
They're redeemed.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:59.870
deploying our forces. Now you believe him. What changed your mind? A lesser man would have told me what I wanted to hear, even if it wasn't true. There's been too much suspicion, too many lies on both sides. Our fleet will intercept the Vulcans at these coordinates. My superiors believe it may be helpful.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.000
if Enterprise were to join us.

00:30:40.400 --> 00:30:40.700
First off.

00:31:02.880 --> 00:31:04.140
Your technique has improved.

00:31:05.020 --> 00:31:14.890
Come home, Sub-Commander.

00:31:15.230 --> 00:31:19.030
I no longer hold that rake.

00:31:19.200 --> 00:31:21.980
You may have joined Starfleet, but you're still Vulcan,

00:31:23.120 --> 00:31:24.440
subject to our laws.

00:31:25.990 --> 00:31:29.970
There are a few crimes still punishable by execution, but...

00:31:30.320 --> 00:31:31.980
There's one of them.

00:31:34.580 --> 00:31:34.920
What is it?

00:31:35.780 --> 00:31:39.440
Seven alien ships have taken position outside the Andorian system.

00:31:40.220 --> 00:31:42.540
They're directly in the path of our fleet.

00:31:42.820 --> 00:31:50.680
Are you sure this is wise?

00:31:51.620 --> 00:31:54.520
If the Vulcans find us here, they might think we're siding with the Andorians.

00:31:54.680 --> 00:31:56.300
There's no guarantee they won't fire on us.

00:31:56.860 --> 00:31:59.710
Sir, I'm reading a massive subspace distortion.

00:32:01.040 --> 00:32:03.360
It's the Vulcans. They'll be here in two hours.

00:32:04.620 --> 00:32:05.600
He's hailing us again.

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:06.360
On screen.

00:32:09.110 --> 00:32:11.970
Our sensors show 12 Vulcan cruisers approaching.

00:32:12.310 --> 00:32:13.630
When will the rest of your fleet get here?

00:32:13.770 --> 00:32:16.980
They won't arrive in time. We're on our own.

00:32:25.290 --> 00:32:28.380
Still not clear how the Kishara's gonna stop a war.

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:35.380
govern without approval from the council the existence of the kishara will persuade them to

00:32:35.380 --> 00:32:46.010
reconsider their support i don't suppose they'll let us just walk into the high command we can

00:32:46.010 --> 00:32:52.320
transport in but we'll need access codes i know someone who might have

00:33:05.310 --> 00:33:11.220
weapons the andorians are doing the same travis put us between both fleets if the vulcans want to

00:33:11.220 --> 00:33:21.260
start a war they're going to have to get through us first what do you think you're doing in case

00:33:21.260 --> 00:33:25.660
you hadn't noticed they outnumber us two to one get back in formation i'm trying to buy us some

00:33:32.240 --> 00:33:34.420
The Andorians have more ships on the way.

00:33:35.090 --> 00:33:36.850
They won't arrive for several hours.

00:33:37.280 --> 00:33:39.720
You told us this strike would be a surprise,

00:33:39.740 --> 00:33:43.360
that there would be minimal casualties on both sides.

00:33:43.860 --> 00:33:47.380
The Andorians are armed with standard particle cannons.

00:33:47.640 --> 00:33:50.000
There is no evidence of Zindi technology.

00:33:52.170 --> 00:33:55.420
Administrator, we have to call off this attack.

00:33:57.550 --> 00:33:58.430
Forces are committed.

00:34:00.030 --> 00:34:00.890
Can't turn back.

00:34:02.200 --> 00:34:03.620
Being hailed by the Starfleet ship.

00:34:06.130 --> 00:34:08.930
Commander Tucker, sorry to spoil your surprise,

00:34:09.170 --> 00:34:10.790
but the Andorians know what you're planning.

00:34:11.240 --> 00:34:13.160
I suggest you turn your ships around now.

00:34:13.550 --> 00:34:15.450
This doesn't concern Starfleet.

00:34:15.830 --> 00:34:17.090
Leave the area immediately.

00:34:17.760 --> 00:34:18.580
I can't do that.

00:34:19.230 --> 00:34:21.190
The Andorians helped us when Earth was under attack.

00:34:21.450 --> 00:34:22.750
We're just here to return the favor.

00:34:23.290 --> 00:34:26.050
If you side with the Andorians, you'll be fired upon.

00:34:26.340 --> 00:34:28.020
I've already sent word to Admiral Gardner.

00:34:28.610 --> 00:34:29.970
If Enterprise is destroyed...

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:31.880
Starfleet is going to know who is responsible.

00:34:34.960 --> 00:34:38.310
The ships to engage the enemy fleet.

00:34:38.650 --> 00:34:41.360
Administrator, I can't allow this.

00:34:42.580 --> 00:34:47.540
Sub-Leternant, if you attempt to interfere again,

00:34:49.460 --> 00:34:56.400
have you arrested the Vulcans?

00:34:57.040 --> 00:34:57.860
They're locking weapons.

00:34:58.100 --> 00:34:58.580
On us?

00:34:59.400 --> 00:34:59.620
No.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:03.860
Just the Andorians. Stand by face cannons. Don't fire until they give the order.

00:35:05.550 --> 00:35:18.940
No fire.

00:35:19.620 --> 00:35:21.430
What about? Get out of their weapons range.

00:35:21.570 --> 00:35:24.170
One of the Andorian ships is in trouble. Their reactor's been hit.

00:35:24.620 --> 00:35:27.280
The Falcon Cruise is heading towards them. See if you can get their attention.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.100
The Earth vessels opened fire on one of our ships.

00:35:32.400 --> 00:35:33.140
Destroy them.

00:35:33.880 --> 00:35:35.700
The cruiser's breaking off its attack.

00:35:36.100 --> 00:35:36.920
We're being targeted.

00:35:38.180 --> 00:35:39.680
Evasive starboard. Full of force.

00:35:40.980 --> 00:35:43.040
Malcolm, we're not making a dent in their shield.

00:35:43.600 --> 00:35:54.470
Hans hailing.

00:35:59.080 --> 00:35:59.960
Tell Archer that...

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:01.400
That's two he owes me!

00:36:21.820 --> 00:36:26.030
It is agreeable to see you again.

00:36:27.870 --> 00:36:29.980
Woman is an anarchy.

00:36:30.030 --> 00:36:34.360
Whatever she's told you isn't the truth.

00:36:34.870 --> 00:36:36.680
T'Pau didn't bomb our embassy.

00:36:39.460 --> 00:36:39.800
You did.

00:36:41.910 --> 00:36:42.970
Vince is conclusive.

00:36:43.600 --> 00:36:45.240
Evidence your people gave us.

00:36:46.560 --> 00:36:50.300
The bombing was an excuse to round up the Syronites.

00:36:50.800 --> 00:36:53.130
Make certain they'd never find this.

00:37:01.440 --> 00:37:04.880
Is that Nusara's a myth?

00:37:32.840 --> 00:37:35.190
It's gone! Torpedoes! The launch is not responding!

00:37:35.850 --> 00:37:38.680
Where the hell is Trian? The Vulcans are keeping it busy!

00:37:39.620 --> 00:37:42.000
Looks like we really are on our own.

00:37:43.200 --> 00:37:45.960
Holographic trick. This proves nothing.

00:37:46.560 --> 00:37:50.280
The artifact must be examined in detail. No.

00:37:50.800 --> 00:37:53.560
Quantum dating will confirm that it's from the time of Sorok.

00:37:54.460 --> 00:37:57.920
Can't bust her! She'd do anything to spread her deviant beliefs.

00:37:58.450 --> 00:37:59.970
Spent years trying to...

00:38:00.560 --> 00:38:02.740
The Kishara will show us our true path.

00:38:03.400 --> 00:38:04.900
Kill us all if they had the chance!

00:38:06.390 --> 00:38:07.690
It's destroyed!

00:38:08.750 --> 00:38:17.560
This is Minister Kuvak. Get me the fleet commander immediately.

00:38:21.500 --> 00:38:22.340
I'm lost health control.

00:38:23.610 --> 00:38:25.840
Hold reach on G-Deck. We're venting atmosphere.

00:38:34.800 --> 00:38:37.460
The Vulcan ships, they're withdrawing.

00:38:37.680 --> 00:38:41.910
We're being hailed. It's the High Command.

00:38:45.580 --> 00:38:47.390
Trip, is everything all right?

00:38:48.310 --> 00:38:51.460
More or less. What's going on, Captain?

00:38:51.700 --> 00:38:56.090
There have been a few changes here. Get back to Vulcan as soon as you can.

00:38:59.080 --> 00:38:59.880
Captain Starlog.

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:05.590
supplemental. Administrator Velas has been relieved of his position. His role in the

00:39:05.590 --> 00:39:10.440
embassy bombing is being investigated. For the moment, conflict between Vulcan and

00:39:10.440 --> 00:39:19.960
Andoria appears to have been averted. Captain Notcher asked me to express his

00:39:19.960 --> 00:39:26.500
gratitude and have succeeded without your transporter codes. You told me you were in

00:39:26.500 --> 00:39:29.820
danger. I wouldn't have been a very good husband if I didn't help.

00:39:31.400 --> 00:39:32.800
I'm not certain when I'll be able to return.

00:39:34.860 --> 00:39:38.100
I'm aware that I promised your family that we would eventually live together.

00:39:38.260 --> 00:39:39.120
That's not why I've come.

00:39:40.450 --> 00:39:41.710
I'm releasing you from our marriage.

00:39:43.820 --> 00:39:45.900
I know you only bonded with me to help your mother.

00:39:47.520 --> 00:39:48.320
She's gone now.

00:39:48.500 --> 00:39:51.200
There's no reason for us to continue.

00:39:53.300 --> 00:39:54.280
You don't have to do this.

00:39:54.960 --> 00:39:55.300
I know.

00:40:00.830 --> 00:40:01.270
Goss.

00:40:05.130 --> 00:40:05.710
Goodbye, Tepo.

00:40:26.580 --> 00:40:28.060
Katra is with me now.

00:40:30.570 --> 00:40:31.490
How do you feel, Captain?

00:40:36.600 --> 00:40:37.680
The giant weight's been lifted.

00:40:38.580 --> 00:40:40.280
Word has already spread of the Discovery.

00:40:41.690 --> 00:40:43.970
It may take years to translate all of the writings.

00:40:44.880 --> 00:40:47.000
The people of Vulcan are in your debt.

00:40:49.040 --> 00:40:51.840
Peace and long life.

00:40:57.690 --> 00:40:59.510
You may be witnessing the start of a new era.

00:41:00.320 --> 00:41:02.380
Not only for Vulcan, but for Earth as well.

00:41:03.400 --> 00:41:06.940
The minister intends to pursue a less aggressive policy toward your people.

00:41:07.260 --> 00:41:09.040
The high command will be dissolved.

00:41:10.070 --> 00:41:11.810
You'll no longer have us looking over your shoulder.

00:41:12.670 --> 00:41:14.290
It's time for Earth to stand on its own.

00:41:15.700 --> 00:41:16.080
We're ready.

00:41:24.960 --> 00:41:25.360
Failed.

00:41:26.360 --> 00:41:27.700
Gates of work have been lost.

00:41:27.900 --> 00:41:29.980
Am I to be blamed for your incompetence?

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:31.300
The monster should have been killed!

00:41:31.660 --> 00:41:33.400
You brought the humans into this!

00:41:34.410 --> 00:41:37.180
I must leave Vulcan. My position here has been compromised.

00:41:37.520 --> 00:41:38.400
What about me?

00:41:38.850 --> 00:41:41.510
Not now. Your disappearance would cause suspicion.

00:41:43.430 --> 00:41:44.830
This is simply a minor delay.

00:41:45.890 --> 00:41:48.770
The reunification of our people is only a matter of time.
